{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4155810/extras/dfe048433aa2a15295ef553327a463ef.poster.avif?t=1762392525\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4155810/extras/dfe048433aa2a15295ef553327a463ef.webm?t=1762392525\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4155810/extras/dfe048433aa2a15295ef553327a463ef.mp4?t=1762392525\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Memory does not always tell the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must piece together the fragmented memories of different individuals and the traces they left behind to uncover the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every clue is connected, but the moment you arrange them in the wrong order, a \u201cfalse story\u201d is born.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And that lie will eventually return to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You do not simply play the game \u2014 you become the observer and interpreter who uncovers what really happened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will trace the day of a disturbing incident, and follow the past, present, and future of those involved.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Memory &amp; Clue Assembly System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2013 Connect each piece in the correct order to reach the truth</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Pressure Through Narrative</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2013 Anxiety, doubt, distorted memories\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nonlinear Story Progression</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2013 No fixed route; interpret the clues in your own way</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Text-Driven Immersive Presentation</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2013 Dialogue, notes, inner thoughts, and visual hints work together</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2013 Minimal graphics, maximum narrative tension</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are more than a player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The incident has already happened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The evidence is scattered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The memories are distorted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, it\u2019s your turn to assemble them.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4155810?t=1762392525","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4155810?t=1762392525","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4155810/347fc7d343a8c36dfd3999840e41d07e659a575d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762392525","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4155810/347fc7d343a8c36dfd3999840e41d07e659a575d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762392525","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4155810/extras/dfe048433aa2a15295ef553327a463ef.poster.avif?t=1762392525\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstat